    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/b6ac2adbcb07ed6213c07bbc60f31b7a.poster.avif?t=1747874050\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/b6ac2adbcb07ed6213c07bbc60f31b7a.webm?t=1747874050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/b6ac2adbcb07ed6213c07bbc60f31b7a.mp4?t=1747874050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Gunflow is Risk of Rain 2 inspired roguelike with the focus on mastering control of the elements through your weapons. Collect new weapons and artifacts, level up and choose which elemental reactions to power up. Achieve colossal strength to fight colossal enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/ba7c456a05f9acd515a3b61ae41516f3.avif?t=1747874050\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/e55509abe83c648e9929f451a3adc9e8.poster.avif?t=1747874050\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/e55509abe83c648e9929f451a3adc9e8.webm?t=1747874050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/e55509abe83c648e9929f451a3adc9e8.mp4?t=1747874050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/50e557a3e0de10dc1da94a0e0ed31b8d.avif?t=1747874050\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/51dfbb59437e7efd054189af77368eb0.poster.avif?t=1747874050\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/51dfbb59437e7efd054189af77368eb0.webm?t=1747874050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/51dfbb59437e7efd054189af77368eb0.mp4?t=1747874050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Combine Fire, Thunder, Water and Earth elements in sets of 3 allowing for 20 different reactions that you can base your build around.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/657c735b7a3c9d87234c7a197e4fc8d1.avif?t=1747874050\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/9d52539120f78a5af402e7d7008cd477.poster.avif?t=1747874050\" width=601 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/9d52539120f78a5af402e7d7008cd477.webm?t=1747874050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Make a party of 4 weapons with various synergies and break the game before the game breaks you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/0c00536474d1a02009bf5d8020dfcfd7.avif?t=1747874050\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/989e708dd0a68c7269393