    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/b6ac2adbcb07ed6213c07bbc60f31b7a.poster.avif?t=1747874050\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/b6ac2adbcb07ed6213c07bbc60f31b7a.webm?t=1747874050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/b6ac2adbcb07ed6213c07bbc60f31b7a.mp4?t=1747874050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Gunflow is Risk of Rain 2 inspired roguelike with the focus on mastering control of the elements through your weapons. Collect new weapons and artifacts, level up and choose which elemental reactions to power up. Achieve colossal strength to fight colossal enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/ba7c456a05f9acd515a3b61ae41516f3.avif?t=1747874050\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/e55509abe83c648e9929f451a3adc9e8.poster.avif?t=1747874050\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/e55509abe83c648e9929f451a3adc9e8.webm?t=1747874050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/e55509abe83c648e9929f451a3adc9e8.mp4?t=1747874050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929330/extras/50e557a3e0de10dc1da94a0e0ed31b8d.avif?t=1747874050\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br><spa